She only remembers what kind of food she ate there.

112
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,900
She was actually a ton of sushi!

113
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:46,980
It's Lady Toro!

114
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:48,160
Here you go, sir.

115
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,640
Our maid cafe specialty, Omo Rice.

116
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,120
Lady Toro!

117
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:53,920
Hi, Kana!

118
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,240
You came by!

119
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:59,160
Why are you wearing that festival uniform instead of your own maid outfit?

120
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:02,620
Eh, the maid outfit is so hard to move around in!

121
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:04,300
I figured you'd say that.

122
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:06,120
What matters most is the heart.

123
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,500
You have Omo Rice?

124
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,400
I want one, too!

125
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,400
Sorry, you have to go wait in line.

126
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,400
Hm?

127
