132
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:26,140
I'll bring you a souvenir plate when I come home.

133
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:27,140
Oh, Toro, you're amazing!

134
00:05:27,140 --> 00:05:28,140
That would be so cool!

135
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:29,140
The tears, though.

136
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,140
Hey, Miss Kobayashi!

137
00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:31,140
